      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The paper presents a case of successful heart chambers and coronary. Maging with gadolinium-based contrast agent Gadobutrol during CT-coronarography with 64-slice scanner in a patient with intolerance to iodinated contrast media. No adverse events were detected. In conclusion, Gadobutrol may be a safe and useful alternative contrast contraindications to iodinated material."},
